{"metadata":{"description":"Content-addressed artifact, fact, action and report lineage for DeepSeek Harness","id":"gh:1333601284","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-lineage","slug":"dongsheng123132/dsh-lineage","topics":["ai-agent","content-addressed-storage","data-lineage","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","provenance"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Content-addressed artifact, fact, action and report lineage for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-lineage"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Maintainer / Author：He Fangsheng (贺方升 / 贺去病; also known as Dosen) · hequbing.com**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Content-addressed data and action lineage evidence for DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"The DSH ecosystem already has a security-audit plugin that reports plugin provenance. `dsh-lineage` "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"addresses a different gap: it builds a local, verifiable object graph for artifacts, verified-fact r"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ecords, actions, and reports. It never stores chat transcripts or factual prose; a node is only a ty"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"ped ID plus an explicit workspace-relative object reference and expected SHA-256."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Version 0.2.0 is a formal Codex plugin and standalone proof-only MCP server, and uses the namespace "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"export shape required by the stock DSH Web Loader. A real Cordis boot regression test guards that lo"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"equired by the stock DSH Web Loader. A real Cordis boot regression test guards that loader contract."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Adjacent tools track Skill bundle versions, hash-chain agent activity, or register provenance. This "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"project stays at the object-graph evidence layer: typed content-addressed nodes, explicit causal edg"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"es, resolvable references, DAG validation, upstream/downstream closure, and missing/stale disclosure"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"s, resolvable references, DAG validation, upstream/downstream closure, and missing/stale disclosure."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Graph model"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Node types:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- `artifact`
- `fact`
- `action`
- `report`"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Edge types point from the dependent object toward its provenance:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- `derived-from`
- `observed-by`
- `produced-by`
- `supersedes`"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Every node reference is dereferenced inside `workspaceRoot` and hashed. The verifier distinguishes:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- `verified`: the object exists and matches its expected hash;
- `missing`: the reference cannot be "},{"id":"p14s2","text":"resolved;
- `stale`: the object exists but its current hash differs;
- dangling graph references, in"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"valid relation types, and cycles."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"No missing or stale object is silently promoted into a fact."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Append-only ledger"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Input is explicit JSONL. Each event has an `idempotencyKey` and either `put-node` or `put-edge`. The"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" key maps to one immutable event file in `ledgerDir`:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"1. validate the complete hypothetical graph before writing;
2. write a temporary file inside the exp"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"licit ledger directory;
3. read it back;
4. atomically hard-link it into its final immutable slot;
5"},{"id":"p18s3","text":". read the published file back and verify SHA-256."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Replaying the same key and event is safe. Reusing a key with different content fails closed. Event f"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"iles are never updated; a new object revision gets a new node ID and a `supersedes` edge."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Safety model"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- All ledger, JSONL, object and report paths are workspace-relative; traversal and symlink component"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"s are rejected.
- Writes occur only inside explicit `ledgerDir` or `artifactDir`.
- Event schemas al"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"low only structural IDs, types, paths and hashes. Keys for claims, chat, prompts, messages, raw cont"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"ent, text, credentials, tokens, cookies and authorization are rejected.
- Referenced object bytes ar"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"e hashed but never copied into the ledger or reports.
- Ingest rejects self-edges, graph cycles and "},{"id":"p21s6","text":"invalid producer/observer/supersedes type constraints before publication.
- Closure reports are cont"},{"id":"p21s7","text":"ent addressed and read-back verified."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Run this over evidence objects you created or were authorized to inspect. A hash proves identity, no"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"t truth; `dsh-lineage` reports what is present, missing or changed and does not invent assertions."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Install in DSH"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Registered tools:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- `dsh_lineage_inspect`
- `dsh_lineage_ingest`
- `dsh_lineage_query`
- `dsh_lineage_verify`"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## MCP"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"`.mcp.json` declares a standalone stdio MCP server:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"- `lineage_events_inspect` validates a bounded inline JSONL graph and reports structural hashes, cou"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"nts, dangling references, cycles and relation errors.
- `lineage_events_query` returns deterministic"},{"id":"p29s3","text":" upstream/downstream closure over those inline events."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"MCP accepts at most 1 MiB of inline structural events. It never dereferences object paths and never "},{"id":"p30s2","text":"reads or writes the filesystem. Persistent append-only ingestion and object-hash verification remain"},{"id":"p30s3","text":" available only through the workspace-bounded DSH tool and CLI surfaces."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## CLI"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"`query` supports `upstream`, `downstream`, and `both`. `verify` exits `0` for a fully verified closu"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"re, `2` when a report is written but evidence is missing/stale/invalid, and `1` for an operational o"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"report is written but evidence is missing/stale/invalid, and `1` for an operational or schema error."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Example"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"See `examples/lineage.events.jsonl`."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## Develop"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"Requires Node.js 22+. There are no runtime dependencies or install lifecycle scripts beyond the opti"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"onal DSH tools SDK peer."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}
